      {
        "id": "the-snapped-crank-and-metal-debris-told-the-full-story",
        "title": "The snapped crank and metal debris told the full story.",
        "description": "The specialist drained the oil and found metal particles throughout. The crankshaft had snapped between two main bearing journals, destroying the block.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "/case-studies/assets/3.1-land-rover-discovery3-tdv6-oil-debris.png",
            "alt": "Land Rover TDV6 oil filter showing metal debris from snapped crankshaft",
