          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "“The crankshaft has snapped. This is a catastrophic bottom-end failure. Land Rover does not allow these engines to be rebuilt satisfactorily by third parties — the block is destroyed, and the crank is in two pieces. You need a full replacement engine.”"
